            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The statistics include the first job (employment or self-employment) after HVE. All paid employment, regardless of duration, such as temporary and summer jobs, should be included. The statistics include graduates from the HVE programmes that were completed the year before the follow-up year. Only graduates who are registered residents in Sweden during the follow-up year are included.",
        "The statistics are subject to uncertainty because not everyone responded to the survey. Therefore, a margin of error is always given. It is a range within which the true value is found with 95 percent certainty"
